    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d100">

                <pb facs="0272" n="233" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v28/pg233"/>

                <head>100. Memorandum From Director of Central Intelligence Colby to the President’s Assistant
                    for National Security Affairs (Kissinger)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d100-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1974-09-19">September 19, 1974</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>
                        Mobutu’s Request for Material
                        Support to Holden Roberto
                    </item>
                </list>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>In line with the request made to you on 12 August 1974 by Umba di Lutete,
                        Foreign Minister of Zaire, on behalf of President Mobutu, for material help to Holden Roberto of the National Front for
                        the Liberation of Angola (FNLA),<anchor
                            n="2" xml:id="d100-f2"/> we plan to increase substantially our present
                        payment of [<hi rendition="#italic">less than 1 line not declassified</hi>]
                        to Holden Roberto [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">less than 1 line not declassified</hi>]</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>We intend to keep these payments fairly low but high enough to assure
                        President Mobutu that we are
                        sympathetic to his concern about the future regime of an independent Angola.
                        The exact amount would be subject to some negotiation with Roberto, but we would expect it to <pb
                            facs="0273" n="234" xml:id="pg234"/> be not more than [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">less than 1 line not declassified</hi>] We would
                        explain the payments to Roberto as
                        designed to help him during a critical time of his career [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">1 line not declassified</hi>]</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#bold">W.E. Colby</hi>
                        <anchor n="3" xml:id="d100-f3"/>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
